# Changes to these paths need a code owner's approval to reach main (and so
# stg and prod): the `deploy-stg` ruleset requires code owner review.

# Pipelines: a workflow on main runs with the stg and prod AWS roles
/.github/workflows/  @turnes

# CI access: AWS roles, OIDC trust, GitHub environments and rulesets
/bootstrap/          @turnes

# This file, so ownership can't be removed without an owner
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @turnes
